                  <h3 class="font-heading font-semibold text-ink" style="font-size: clamp(1.15rem, 2vw, 1.4rem); letter-spacing: -0.02em; line-height: 1.15;">I'm looking for violin lessons for my child.</h3>
                </div>
                <button
                  class="pathway-close flex-shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-white border border-lavender-200 text-ink/50 hover:text-ink hover:border-lavender-300 transition-colors duration-150 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-purplePrimary"
                  data-close="parents" aria-label="Close this section" type="button"
                >
                  <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="18" y1="6" x2="6" y2="18"/><line x1="6" y1="6" x2="18" y2="18"/></svg>
                </button>
              </div>
              <!-- desktop heading -->
              <div class="hidden md:block">
                <p class="font-heading font-semibold text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-purplePrimary mb-2" style="letter-spacing: 0.14em;">For parents</p>
                <h3 class="font-heading font-semibold text-ink" style="font-size: clamp(1.15rem, 2vw, 1.4rem); letter-spacing: -0.02em; line-height: 1.15;">I'm looking for violin lessons for my child.</h3>
              </div>
              <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-purplePrimary uppercase tracking-widest" style="letter-spacing: 0.13em;">Let's get curious —</p>
              <p class="font-heading font-semibold text-ink" style="font-size: 1.05rem; letter-spacing: -0.01em; line-height: 1.2; margin-top: -0.75rem;">Tell me about your child.</p>
              <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color: #3A3140;">
                <p>I'd love to learn more about your child — what lights them up, how they learn, and what you're hoping music might bring into their life.</p>
                <p>Our first conversation is a chance to talk about your questions, your child's interests, and what a meaningful start could look like.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Right: topics + close button -->
            <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 p-7">
              <div class="hidden md:flex items-start justify-end">
                <button
                  class="pathway-close flex-shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-white border border-lavender-200 text-ink/50 hover:text-ink hover:border-lavender-300 transition-colors duration-150 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-purplePrimary"
                  data-close="parents" aria-label="Close this section" type="button"
                >
                  <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="18" y1="6" x2="6" y2="18"/><line x1="6" y1="6" x2="18" y2="18"/></svg>
                </button>
              </div>
              <h4 class="font-heading font-semibold text-ink text-sm uppercase tracking-wide" style="letter-spacing: 0.08em;">Common topics I can help you explore</h4>
              <ul class="flex flex-col gap-4" role="list">
                <li style="color: #3A3140;">
                  <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-ink leading-snug mb-0.5">Getting started with violin</p>
                  <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed">What beginners need and how first lessons are paced.</p>
                </li>
                <li style="color: #3A3140;">
                  <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-ink leading-snug mb-0.5">Practice support at home</p>
                  <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed">How families can encourage learning without adding pressure.</p>
                </li>
                <li style="color: #3A3140;">
                  <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-ink leading-snug mb-0.5">Creating a positive learning experience</p>
                  <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed">Supporting curiosity, engagement, and long-term enjoyment of music.</p>
                </li>
              </ul>
            </div>

          </div>

          <!-- Bottom CTA bar -->
          <div class="border-t border-lavender-200 px-7 py-5 flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center gap-4">
            <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed flex-1" style="color: #3A3140;">No pressure, no commitment.</p>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 flex-shrink-0">
              <a href="https://calendly.com/vibesviolinstudio/30min" class="btn-primary text-sm" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Book a 15-Minute Intro Chat</a>
              <a href="#inquiry-engine" class="btn-secondary text-sm send-message-link">Send a Message</a>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Panel: Adult Beginners -->
      <div
        id="pathway-adults"
        class="pathway-panel hidden mt-8"
        role="region"
        aria-label="For adult learners — pathway details"
      >
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-lavender-200 bg-lavender-50 overflow-hidden">

          <!-- 3-col content grid -->
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-[240px_1fr_1fr] gap-0">

            <!-- Left: image -->
